What's new in 1.2.0

• Weekly Challenges — a new board each week. Play them back to back for a streak.
• Achievements — badges for finishing each world.
• Cloud Save — progress follows you between devices via Play Games or Game Center.
• Better hints — one free every 24 hours, plus more earned from challenges.
• Ad preferences — choose how your data is used, from Settings.
• Stuck? The retry screen now offers a hand.
• Bug fixes and performance improvements.
